OL,3,GNEWSAVAT burden and healthcare waits
OL,4,Aamong northern concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong waiting times for healthcare, the
OL,7,Favailability of bus services, and the
OL,8,Fburden of VAT on the hospitality trade
OL,9,Fare among the concerns for those living
OL,10,Fin the Ayre and Michael.
OL,12,FThe largest by landmass of the Isle of
OL,13,FMan's12 constituencies, it stretches
OL,14,Ffrom the western coast to the most
OL,15,Fnortherly tip of the island.
OL,17,FAlthough made up of six distinct
OL,18,Fparishes, similar concerns echo through
OL,19,Fthem all.
